@SmartLine.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5047
@AccessToken = replace-with-login-access-token
@DeviceKey = replace-with-development-device-key

### Login (refresh token Secure/HttpOnly cookie olarak döner)
POST {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "operator@example.local",
  "password": "replace-with-operator-password"
}

###

### Refresh
POST {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Accept: application/json

###

### ============================================================
### DASHBOARD
### ============================================================

### Dashboard özet verisi
GET {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###

### ============================================================
### CONVEYOR (KONVEYÖR)
### ============================================================

### Konveyör durumunu getir
GET {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/conveyor/status
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###

### Konveyörü başlat
POST {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/conveyor/start
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###

### Konveyörü durdur
POST {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/conveyor/stop
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###

### Acil durdurma (normal control limiter'dan bağımsız)
POST {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/conveyor/emergency-stop
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###

### Acil durdurma reseti (Admin; konveyörü başlatmaz)
POST {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/conveyor/emergency-reset
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###

### Konveyör hızını güncelle
POST {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/conveyor/speed
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

{
  "speed": 75
}

###

### ============================================================
### SENSORS (SENSÖRLER)
### ============================================================

### Ortam verisi gönder (normal)
POST {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/sensors/environment
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Device-Key: {{DeviceKey}}

{
  "temperature": 25.5,
  "humidity": 60.0
}

###

### Ortam verisi gönder (yüksek sıcaklık — fan aktif)
POST {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/sensors/environment
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Device-Key: {{DeviceKey}}

{
  "temperature": 45.0,
  "humidity": 70.0
}

###

### Barkod verisi gönder (normal ürün)
POST {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/sensors/barcode
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Device-Key: {{DeviceKey}}

{
  "barcode": "BC001",
  "color": "RED"
}

###

### Barkod verisi gönder (geçerli ikinci ürün)
POST {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/sensors/barcode
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Device-Key: {{DeviceKey}}

{
  "barcode": "BC002",
  "color": "BLUE"
}

###

### Barkod verisi gönder (barkod okunamadı)
POST {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/sensors/barcode
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Device-Key: {{DeviceKey}}

{
  "barcode": "",
  "color": null
}

###

### Yangın algılandı
POST {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/sensors/fire
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Device-Key: {{DeviceKey}}

{
  "isDetected": true,
  "deviceEpoch": "0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef",
  "fireGeneration": 1
}

###

### Yangın bitti (normal durum)
POST {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/sensors/fire
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Device-Key: {{DeviceKey}}

{
  "isDetected": false,
  "deviceEpoch": "0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef",
  "fireGeneration": 1
}

###

### Sensör durumunu getir
GET {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/sensors/status
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###

### ============================================================
### PRODUCTS (ÜRÜNLER)
### ============================================================

### Tüm ürünleri getir (sayfalı)
GET {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/products?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###

### Hatalı ürünleri getir
GET {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/defective?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###

### Barkoda göre ürün getir
GET {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/barcode/BC001
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###

### ID'ye göre ürün getir (var olan bir ID ile değiştir)
GET {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###

### ============================================================
### ALERTS (ALARMLAR)
### ============================================================

### Tüm alarmları getir (sayfalı)
GET {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/alerts?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###

### Aktif alarmları getir
GET {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/alerts/active
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###

### Alarmı çözümle (var olan bir ID ile değiştir)
POST {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/alerts/1/resolve
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###

### ============================================================
### STATISTICS (İSTATİSTİKLER)
### ============================================================

### Günlük istatistikleri getir
GET {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/statistics/daily
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###

### Saatlik istatistikleri getir
GET {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/statistics/hourly
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###

### ============================================================
### LOGS (LOGLAR)
### ============================================================

### Tüm logları getir (sayfalı)
GET {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/logs?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###

### Önem seviyesine göre logları getir (INFO / WARNING / ERROR)
GET {{SmartLine.API_HostAddress}}/api/logs/severity/WARNING?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###
